// Data.SortedMap keeps the Ord of its keys in the map's constructors. In
// full Core that field is gone from each map instance (the implementation
// is a compile-time value of the instance, which its methods specialize
// on, and nothing erased is a field), and no data instance of the
// interface exists anywhere.
// CHECK-NOT: {{^data Prelude\.EqOrd\.(Ord|Eq)\[}}
// CHECK: {{^}}data Data.SortedMap.Dependent.SortedDMap[String, {{.*}}]
// CHECK-NEXT: Empty tag 0 ()
// CHECK-NEXT: M tag 1 (w Nat, w Data.SortedMap.Dependent.Tree[
// CHECK: {{^}}data Data.SortedMap.Dependent.SortedDMap[Int, {{.*}}]
// CHECK-NEXT: Empty tag 0 ()
// CHECK-NEXT: M tag 1 (w Nat, w Data.SortedMap.Dependent.Tree[
// CHECK-NOT: {{^data Prelude\.EqOrd\.(Ord|Eq)\[}}
